  "foundation_viability_test": [
    "Can a later participant identify the founding reference without personal access to the founder?",
    "Can the rules/practice be re-enacted by a new generation?",
    "Is there an admission/succession mechanism?",
    "Can disputes be resolved without inventing the system anew?",
    "Can the foundation revise itself without losing all identity?",
    "Does material capacity exist to support reproduction?",
    "Is provenance preserved well enough to distinguish continuity from retrospective myth?"
